# Chapter 0's phase handoff, its SHA-256 sidecar and latest.json record SHA-256 hashes of exact
# file bytes. These paths check out with LF on every platform and core.autocrlf setting, so a
# checkout reproduces the committed bytes and the recorded hashes keep matching the files on disk.
docs/architecture/chapter0/** text=auto eol=lf
docs/implementation/handoffs/** text=auto eol=lf
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md text=auto eol=lf
# Chapter 1 Phase A's files are hashed in its handoff, ch01-phase-a.json, so they check out with LF
# for the same reason.
docs/architecture/chapter1/** text=auto eol=lf
